    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Madden are delighted to bring to the market this charming mid-terrace property.\n\nAbbey Street is a quiet street, which has retained its character and charm, with it's well kept original buildings together with some newer development and is within walking distance of Portumna Marina, Portumna Forest Park and town centre.\nThe residence offers accommodation over two floors including living room, kitchen/diner, 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms. \n\nViewing of this property is highly recommended.\nTo arrange a viewing appointment or for further information please contact Sherry FitzGerald Madden."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 1.95m x 3.59m\nFront aspect door, understair storage, laminate flooring\n\nLiving Room - 2.48m x 3.60m\nFront aspect window, gas fire with tile surround, laminate flooring\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.35m x 3.19m\nRear aspect window, fitted wall and base units, tile flooring\n\nUtility Room - 1.27m x 2.99m\nSide aspect door, tiled flooring\n\nBathroom - 2.22m x 2.84m\nSide aspect window, whb/wc/electric shower, floor to ceiling tiling\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 1.66m x 1.96m\nCarpet flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.46m x 3.84m\nFront dual aspect windows, carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.47m x 3.21m\nRear aspect window, carpet flooring\n\nBathroom - 1.76m x 2.23m\nRear aspect window, whb/wc/ electric shower, floor to ceiling tiling\n\nOutdoors - \nLarge yard to rear of property with stone shed. Garden area to rear of shed.\n\n"
      },
